  <MemeDef ParentName="LP_MemeBase">
    <defName>LP_Meme_Pantheon</defName>
    <label>众神殿</label>
    <description>众神各司其职，凡人可以向任何一位祈求。可以和一位主神共存。\n\n被动：祈祷神眷×1.25；更换守护神的冷却减半（没有主神时）；圣坛上可以为任何一位可信奉的神举办庆典（每神每年一次，每年最多4场）。</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Memes/LP/Pantheon</iconPath>
    <impact>1</impact>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>LP_PantheonMeme</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <agreeableTraits>
      <LP_Devotee>1</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>2</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>3</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>4</LP_Devotee>
      <li>LP_Background_Acolyte</li>
      <li>LP_Background_Sage</li>
    </agreeableTraits>
    <disagreeableTraits>
      <li>LP_Atheist</li>
    </disagreeableTraits>
    <generalRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>memeAdjective->众神</li>
        <li>memeAdjective->万神</li>
        <li>memeHyphenPrefix->神</li>
        <li>memeConcept->众神</li>
        <li>memeLeaderNoun->众神之仆</li>
        <li>memeLeaderAdjective->神圣</li>
        <li>memeMoralist->司祭</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </generalRules>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="LichPhylactery.LP_IdeoDeityExtension">
        <statue>LP_Statue_Pantheon</statue>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </MemeDef>

  <MemeDef ParentName="LP_MemeBase">
    <defName>LP_Meme_Defiant</defName>
    <label>不跪之人</label>
    <description>神明不过是更强大的存在，凡人不欠他们什么。\n\n被动：受到的神术效果×0.75（敌我都算，和无神者的×0.5取较小值）；心智抗性+5%；殖民地有圣坛时心情-2（讨厌的神龛）。</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Memes/LP/Defiant</iconPath>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>LP_DeityMeme</li>
      <li>LP_PantheonMeme</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <agreeableTraits>
      <li>LP_Atheist</li>
    </agreeableTraits>
    <disagreeableTraits>
      <LP_Devotee>1</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>2</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>3</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>4</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>5</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>6</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>7</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>8</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>9</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>10</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>11</LP_Devotee>
    </disagreeableTraits>
    <generalRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>memeAdjective->不跪</li>
        <li>memeAdjective->凡人</li>
        <li>memeHyphenPrefix->凡</li>
        <li>memeConcept->自主</li>
        <li>memeLeaderNoun->首领</li>
        <li>memeLeaderAdjective->倔强</li>
        <li>memeMoralist->说理人</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </generalRules>
  </MemeDef>

  <MemeDef ParentName="LP_MemeBase">
    <defName>LP_Meme_Weave</defName>
    <label>魔网至上</label>
    <description>魔法是世界最高的真理，掌握魔网的人理应站在顶端。\n\n被动：耐瑟卷轴研读经验×1.15；模组施法能力（神术、卷轴、巫妖法术）冷却×0.95。</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Memes/LP/Weave</iconPath>
    <impact>1</impact>
    <requireOne>
      <li><li>LP_Arcane_Supreme</li></li>
    </requireOne>
    <agreeableTraits>
      <li>LP_Background_Sage</li>
      <LP_Devotee>3</LP_Devotee>
    </agreeableTraits>
    <generalRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>memeAdjective->奥术</li>
        <li>memeAdjective->织法</li>
        <li>memeHyphenPrefix->法</li>
        <li>memeConcept->魔网</li>
        <li>memeLeaderNoun->大法师</li>
        <li>memeLeaderAdjective->奥术</li>
        <li>memeMoralist->讲法者</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </generalRules>
  </MemeDef>

  <MemeDef ParentName="LP_MemeBase">
    <defName>LP_Meme_Undeath</defName>
    <label>永夜不朽</label>
    <description>死亡只是一道门槛，跨过去的人才配得上永恒。\n\n被动：本文化的巫妖每天确信度+1%；巫妖复生时全体心情+3（主人归来，由「亡灵观：神圣」给出）。</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Memes/LP/Undeath</iconPath>
    <requireOne>
      <li><li>LP_Undead_Sacred</li></li>
    </requireOne>
    <disagreeableTraits>
      <LP_Devotee>1</LP_Devotee>
      <LP_Devotee>4</LP_Devotee>
    </disagreeableTraits>
    <generalRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>memeAdjective->永夜</li>
        <li>memeAdjective->不朽</li>
        <li>memeHyphenPrefix->冥</li>
        <li>memeConcept->不朽</li>
        <li>memeLeaderNoun->命匣守护者</li>
        <li>memeLeaderAdjective->不朽</li>
        <li>memeMoralist->亡语者</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </generalRules>
  </MemeDef>

  <MemeDef ParentName="LP_MemeBase">
    <defName>LP_Meme_Ordning</defName>
    <label>巨人位阶</label>
    <description>巨人的世界有严格的位阶（Ordning），越高大越尊贵。\n\n被动：巨躯殖民者对其他殖民者的社交影响+10%。</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Memes/LP/Ordning</iconPath>
